  "details": "When using the dolly camera system with streaming set to multi to run multiple paths at the same time, the zoom information and other camera parameters are not applied, even if they were programmed when placing the camera points.\n\nOnly the first path that uses the main camera have the parameters applied on it.\n\nOthers topic talks about the same issue for focus and exposure on VRCSender 2, 3, 4.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/dolly-1582-dolly-animated-focus-zoom-changes-freeze-when-camera-window-is-closed\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1609-multi-stream-vrcsender2-3-4-cameras-do-not-have-bloom\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/dolly-multistreaming-inconsistencies-between-cameras",
